  "bio": "Luca Felix Verzi, a seasoned tattoo artist from Milan, Italy, is cherished for his exquisite skill in 'fineline' tattoo artistry. His background as an illustrator and graphic designer significantly fuels his proficiency, making his works the perfect blend of visual and decorative art. From his designs to his crisp lines, Luca's dedication to his craft is undeniable.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Milan, Lombardy, Italy\n\n🇫🇷 Nice Tat Conv 4 - 6 Apr.\n🩸Creo tatuaggi in stile incisione antica.\n🏛️ 10+ anni di rappresentazioni sulla pelle!\n☺️ scrivimi e parliamone! 👇",
